# Modernization Walkthrough: Decommission Twilio & Consolidate on Meta WhatsApp Cloud API

## Overview
All legacy Twilio-specific adapters, routing, signature verification, outbound client dispatchers, test suites, and environment secrets have been removed. The entire Ulavan Connect platform is now standardized exclusively on the **Meta WhatsApp Cloud API (Developer App)**.

